bably the best reason yet to own the console. Thu Nov 5: Motorola Signature 27 launches globally – 200MP periscope with up to 100x zoom and seven years of Android updates. Motorola wants a seat at the flagship table. See it coming.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/ZJUKCWu5oBsqmMI6xDWe3c6wT3XtAHcDy4c_kdYuZXhlBwTbEAmzwpmxKnwERUjYfvMmphMp2wIzOoCmncj65hLNb68HyK_Jc4BKq6RxGrcmpSBko6bIm1rtZorFA1VQCgeUWf_GcfTFH_xMvPjPw4t5FVaevj4wFFz-RlXAVFeZn_XdnE_wgx-Uk5WppxtdfK_KsiPQ1rBJDAGzwkGM4NwXkiuqPDSTuA_8WMrZ-qyyEFbOkphme66ofTMuzSvKCp-4kKwFiJSEYqWTEufpE4ZRF_NrRu11d8RMTSLZei52mp6jHjbu_LUjpz4bCXPSf71v3sSSVquuH1HnqYBcYQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"680","date":"2026-11-01T18:04:24+00:00","text":"All the leaks for the Portal prequel F-Stop have been compiled into a playable game Read on Engadget","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/PCpLE9wQ_Up-T6egmYKg9qhmlGw3aHWN1e0ChtjpaHpPptNT4sDNVgFym81SKsxJsm3Wkko2frLT6DDr5O6g-VhAMYJqV9kLS5BZEgt8sX7JalTzcs9mn6rWgIPKAfZLqQ93YIKwohFiOkgDvluJoKVBUrlw-Kkenpi6EM8PWtZZgCR344tx_MM5B3tKKcUYhnWF0g70ZPKeTQX192wM_o5Q2ghIoMao3hnWBx3Bz9z9Vsdvzd48rUovjp0gF8naum8APVKYjDW3Wy0K4QxKJE4oCdEqXdXqJO8MHLkT8CFOvU8khVuSq8uGbniQbPuubZ5tilCCTuxlwghtVkahsg.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"679","date":"2026-11-01T17:54:22+00:00","text":"The reason why your Xbox controller still uses AA batteries Read on Engadget","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/HmoVN1ypUrD_zhpqa6zpjDPfrBVXlNfUswJAhs6RawpEMWRtSHrVVnXzhSa5lJo6WFAHR_vmm7r9vILeq_I5KJUEXn33CzCO-jmFUyzr_FyT9CxXSF4-xS9kDMddzBhruAA80AZsl_7DDoQUiQVuTdXGumzQK7YrmjIvHttYK1n7bdAm_37u4kVw5_YSZdBavKNpfOJLQRCQ4frOkCiUaCz0Cu9d3xxGi_g_AkjnG27ziOXWY1I8agiA_EUg3ns36ltgwEMl_5CIWHiGSZnXMfXzaRWzcTVukvTSLj4HVf0ar9k4hQ0ucl3Km2xD2SRzsI6QqxW8YjvjahkaNOOQKA.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"678","date":"2026-11-01T17:54:21+00:00","text":"5 nifty ways you can reuse your old laptop Read on Engadget","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/CTw5U1rq4hXaIWTvUbhvRov0IhdtsVZ0KzEiRap3-5_LeHNtNGsvydJY4MAD7bcVRTTbUKVRVffVB8